    description: "Running list of items marked done/pending_validation where bakeoff validation was explicitly deferred. These need real-world testing.\n\nDEFERRED BAKEOFFS:\n\n1. WI-kuroj (INV-dihos Phase 1: Return-Type Registry for Java+Go) - PR #2824. BAKEOFF: Re-run prometheus deep-bakeoff. Forward slice from cmd/promtool/main.go:queryRange should walk into promql.Engine.exec -> evalSampleVector.\n\n2. WI-sukav (Per-language gate on concrete-extends -> virtual dispatch) - PR #2817. BAKEOFF: Re-run alertmanager deep-bakeoff. 4 InclusiveRange.* false positives should disappear. concrete->concrete dispatches_to ratio should drop from 4.95% toward 0.\n\n3. INV-bivot (Slice BFS must traverse event_publishes edges) - pending_validation. BAKEOFF: Run kafka or another event-driven repo through bakeoff-deep. Forward slice from producer should reach consumer methods via event_publishes edges.\n\nUpdate this item each time an item is marked done with deferred bakeoff validation."  # 35be
